			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730680401,
					"content": "是蘭那庫拉！順利回到桓那蘭那了呢。還有…不認識的蘭那羅！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680402,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}，還有派蒙！法留納神機治好了，蘭那庫拉可以專心照看苗圃了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680403,
					"content": "這是蘭伽盧，蘭那庫拉和蘭伽盧一起照料桓那蘭那的苗圃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680404,
					"content": "這裡就是蘭那庫拉總是提起的苗圃啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680405,
					"content": "是的，這裡的土，原本適合生長，可以種出高興的毗波耶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680406,
					"content": "還有不高興的毗波耶？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680407,
					"content": "也不是不高興，只是沒那麼高興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭伽盧"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680408,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680409,
					"content": "就像，有適合生長的土壤，也不缺雨水和陽光，成長的過程中也沒有遇到什麼阻礙…好像沒什麼不高興的，但是也沒那麼高興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680410,
					"content": "喔…感覺就普普通通的。欸？那這裡和其他地方不一樣嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680411,
					"content": "桓那蘭那的土，都很好，但是這裡特別好。而且還有更重要的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680412,
					"content": "蘭伽盧和蘭那庫拉，會照看它們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭伽盧"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680413,
					"content": "照看…具體是指哪方面呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680414,
					"content": "會演奏音樂給它們聽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680415,
					"content": "還會誇它們長得漂亮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭伽盧"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680416,
					"content": "這就是野生和家養的區別嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680417
					]
